            "notes": "The deck focuses on utilizing aggressive creatures and powerful support cards to quickly overwhelm the opponent. Brigid, Clachan's Heart serves as the commander, providing repeated value to help maintain board control. Cards like Swords to Plowshares and Skyclave Apparition deal with threats efficiently, while cards like Stoneforge Mystic and Recruiter of the Guard fetch essential equipment and creatures. The deck utilizes mana dorks like Birds of Paradise and Elves to ramp up quickly, allowing for explosive plays. With a mix of removal, card advantage, and efficient creatures, the deck aims to apply pressure early and maintain momentum throughout the game to come out on top in one-on-one battles."
